  {'rank':3,'id':'family-palette-and-surface-separation','outcome':'Coral rail,blue-gray slate deck,honey wood support and optional restrained brass accents read as one family with the approved native straight. The deck is distinct from its grooves; wood retains visible warm body color. Neighbor joins do not expose abrupt tint/value/material changes.'},
